{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2022-10-04 09:01:00', 'title': "INTRODUCING BLACK+DECKER® KITCHEN WAND™: THE BRAND'S FIRST CORDLESS, KITCHEN MULTI-TOOL", 'text': 'DESIGNED FOR A VARIETY OF HOME COOKING APPLICATIONS, THE BLACK+DECKER® KITCHEN WAND™ IS THE ULTIMATE KITCHEN SIDEKICK™ UP TO SIX ATTACHMENTS AVAILABLE FOR PURCHASE: AN IMMERSION BLENDER, WHISK, MILK FROTHER, SALT AND PEPPER GRINDER, WINE BOTTLE OPENER AND CAN OPENER ATTACHMENTS DELIVERS UP TO 30 MINUTES OF CONTINUOUS RUNTIME*, EQUIVALENT TO BLENDING UP TO 75 BOWLS OF SOUP ON A SINGLE CHARGE** TOWSON, MD. , OCT. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BLACK+DECKER®, A STANLEY BLACK & DECKER BRAND (NYSE: SWK) AND A LEADER IN THE HOME AND LIFESTYLE SPACE, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE LAUNCH OF THE BLACK+DECKER KITCHEN WAND™, ITS FIRST CORDLESS, KITCHEN MULTI-TOOL DESIGNED FOR A VARIETY OF HOME COOKING APPLICATIONS.'}